  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP-Improving the Efficiency of Justice System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project will improve the overall efficiency of the justice system in Montenegro by using ICT technologies in the daily work and management of the judiciary institutions. The project will focus on accelerating the implementation of the Montenegrin ICT Strategy for justice system 2016-2020. Partner is Ministry of Justice of Montenegro.</narrative>
  </description>
